PARITY SUMMARY vs web/src/features/admin/components/devtools/ClientUtilitiesSection.tsx
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data (shared P1/S8 state-holder; no HTTP in the view):
  useToolList -> ClientUtilitiesSource.tools() (static client-side registry; web useMemo, never empty)
  useTranslation -> stringResource (P1/S10 catalog) at the render boundary
Registry: the 15 web tools in order (vin/jwt/timestamp/base64/url/json/uuid/hash/bytes/color/cron/
  http/tesla-api/regex/unix-perm), each with its web id slug, lucide-equivalent glyph and neon accent.
Composition (web): search Input over a 1-col list of expandable cards (icon chip + name + desc +
  chevron); tapping toggles expansion to host the tool body; "No tools match your search" when the
  filter empties the list. The interactive tool bodies are separate surfaces (A-0011..A-0025); they
  are hosted via the toolContent slot (native equivalent of web <tool.Component />), keeping this
  surface decoupled from the out-of-scope per-tool prompts.
Search: case- + whitespace-insensitive match on resolved name OR description (web filtered memo).
States (all rendered): loading skeleton chrome / hard error + QueryError retry / data-empty /
  content (search + cards) / stale + offline (cached registry kept visible, freshness chip + refresh,
  auto-refresh once). The static registry resolves to content; the rest are reachable via a fake
  source (unit tests) and hand-built UiState (previews + UI test) so no state is hidden.
i18n (P1/S10; catalog NOT edited by this artifact):
  search hint = translation_devtools_searchTools ("Search tools...")
  no results = translation_devtools_noToolsFound ("No tools match your search")
  Base64 name/desc = translation_devtools_utils_base64 / _base64Desc
  Timestamp name = translation_Timestamp (its desc + the other 13 tool name/desc keys are absent from
  the upstream web locale files, so the surface reproduces i18next key-as-fallback verbatim — exactly
  what the web renders — rather than inventing catalog entries; refresh/loading = common_refresh / a11y_loading).
Accessibility: each card header is a merged Role.Button announcing its name+description; the search
  field is labelled; the refresh control carries a contentDescription; the loading region is labelled;
  chevron rotation + expand/collapse honour reduced-motion (duration collapses to 0). API 26+, MaterialTheme tokens.
Telemetry (P1/S11): view.opened emitted once with mapOf("surface" to "ClientUtilitiesSection"); PII-free.

